{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Betrayed. Left to die. Now, you awaken in a fractured cybernetic reality, your mind and body fused with deadly and cutting-edge cybertronic abilities. The corruption that created you thinks you are gone, but they will soon learn how wrong they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/fast-combat-header.png?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a deadly arsenal of cyber-enhanced attacks, single blade, dual daggers, and devastating special abilities. Every strike is precise. Every move is lethal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/fractured-world-header.png?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through the woodlands, neon-lit city streets, high-tech facilities, and corporate towers. Reality bends in cyber challenges, where the player must face delusions of their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/enemy-encounters-header.png?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a relentless army of corporate enforcers, drones, and cybernetic assassins. Adapt to new enemy types and survive the evolving battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/customization-header.png?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your weapons, increase your combat abilities, and unlock powerful new skills and techniques to become the ultimate samurai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to slice your path through the heart of the corruption?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590120?t=1742954274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590120?t=1742954274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/331afb69b9be136c4c145d899f8e83f4462744eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742954274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/331afb69b9be136c4c145d899f8e83f4462744eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742954274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Betrayed. Left to die. Now, you awaken in a fractured cybernetic reality, your mind and body fused with deadly and cutting-edge cybertronic abilities. The corruption that created you thinks you are gone, but they will soon learn how wrong they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590120/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1742954274\" /></p><p class=\"b